  "description": "PENVUC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H110 Co2 N4 O34 Tb4,2(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.932-3.923 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.87-117.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4Co2(HL)2(μ3-OCH3)2(piv)8(NO3)2(CH3OH)2]·2CH3OH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
